{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scgpt encoder in a multiprofile setting with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5305 and F1 of 0.5152. The results suggest scgpt may offer modest improvements over previous encoders in this setting, but the multiprofile configuration's contribution to performance remains uncertain. The exact impact of scgpt versus other encoders is unclear due to confounding factors from the multiprofile setting and limited comparative evidence."
}

